/-!
# A109180

The set N of numbers such that each positive integer can be written in the form F + n, where F is a Fibonacci number and n in N, in an even number of ways.

The 69 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

